% The Daml Script test_split of the project Daml intro, composing choices: assets, roles and an atomic trade, run on its twin (compose.le, which this program extends).

the target language is: lps.

the knowledge base compose_test_split extends compose.

the maximum time is 11.

the knowledge base compose_test_split includes:

% Daml (the script run on a Canton sandbox) ends with these active contracts (their payloads;
% the ids are the ledger's):
%   - asset_holder(usd_bank,alice)
%   - asset_holder(usd_bank,bob)
%   - asset(usd_bank,alice,"USD",30.0,[])
%   - asset(usd_bank,alice,"USD",70.0,[])
% The twin's final state under LPS2 (`lps state`) is compared with it by test_daml.pl.
scenario test_split is:
    % the Daml Script test_split
    usd_bank creates the asset holder invite ahia with issuer usd_bank and owner alice from 1 to 2.
    usd_bank creates the asset holder invite ahib with issuer usd_bank and owner bob from 2 to 3.
    alice exercises accept on the asset holder invite ahia creating aha from 3 to 4.
    bob exercises accept on the asset holder invite ahib creating ahb from 4 to 5.
    usd_bank exercises issue asset on the asset holder aha with symbol "USD" and quantity 100.0 creating asset_cid from 5 to 6.
    % Daml refuses the next command (submitMustFail): the twin's integrity constraints refuse it
    alice exercises split on the asset asset_cid with split quantity -30.0 creating c1 and c2 from 6 to 7.
    % Daml refuses the next command (submitMustFail): the twin's integrity constraints refuse it
    alice exercises split on the asset asset_cid with split quantity 0.0 creating c3 and c4 from 7 to 8.
    % Daml refuses the next command (submitMustFail): the twin's integrity constraints refuse it
    alice exercises split on the asset asset_cid with split quantity 101.0 creating c5 and c6 from 8 to 9.
    alice exercises split on the asset asset_cid with split quantity 30.0 creating split_result_1 and split_result_2 from 9 to 10.

